  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"28\" width=\"175\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kkempfer/resources/14aecd1d9f528bca31555c9b5fea2baacf87d816/assets/curseforge/available_on_curseforge.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcreate-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"28\" width=\"160\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kkempfer/resources/14aecd1d9f528bca31555c9b5fea2baacf87d816/assets/modrinth/available_on_modrinth.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/kkempfer/Create-Immersive-Aircrafts-Andesite-Chests-Compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"github\" height=\"28\" width=\"148\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kkempfer/resources/14aecd1d9f528bca31555c9b5fea2baacf87d816/assets/github/available_on_github.svg\"></a></p>\n<p>Этот небольшой набор текстур добавляет андезитовые сундуки из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/andesite-chests-crafting-table\" rel=\"nofollow\">Andesite Chests + Crafting Table</a> от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mental_xpc/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">mental_xpc</a> в <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Aircrafts</a> от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nicky__21/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">nicky__21</a>.</p>\n<p>Версия 1.1.0 для 1.20.1 также включает военный корабль из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Aircraft : Warship</a> от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crazyfl_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">crazyfl_</a>. Обратите внимание, что <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Aircraft : Warship</a> является необязательным, и этот набор текстур будет работать без него.</p>\n<p>Для установки загрузите этот набор текстур после <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/andesite-chests-crafting-table\" rel=\"nofollow\">Andesite Chests + Crafting Table</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Aircrafts</a> и, при желании, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Immersive Aircraft : Warship</a>, как показано выше.</p>\n<p>Если вам нравится моя работа, рассмотрите возможность поддержать меня!</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmortivak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"ko-fi\" height=\"60\" width=\"159\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kkempfer/resources/14aecd1d9f528bca31555c9b5fea2baacf87d816/assets/kofi/kofi_bg_tag_white.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fmortivak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"buy me a coffee\" height=\"60\" width=\"214\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kkempfer/resources/14aecd1d9f528bca31555c9b5fea2baacf87d816/assets/buymeacoffee/bmc-button.svg\"></a></p>",
